// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - RescueGirl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2286231002" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>I'm glad you're ready for duty, heroes; I could really use your help. My men are stretched too thin fighting the many battles in this lawless city, but I've got a situation that has to be dealt with post haste. I just got word that a young woman has been kidnapped by the Freakshow. <color orange>I want you and your team to hunt those villains down and bring the woman back to safety.</color> Can you help?"
// AcceptString :
"P2017240226" "Rescue the woman"
// SendOffString :
"P929160273" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>We've traced the Freaks back to this hole in the ground, but I don't have the forces to root them out. <br><br>Go in there and bring the kidnapped woman back alive. You are authorized to use any measures necessary to restrain her captors."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2961060856" "Defeat Mad Maartin & his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2031730890" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>Have you found the girl yet? I don't want her life on my hands!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P389340388" "The cackle of hideous laughter rolls up from the depths of these fetid corridors."

