// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2894370394" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>I've contacted Missy's father, Dr. Minton. He's grateful to have his daughter back safe and sound, but he reported that the Freaks did ransack his laboratory, just as Missy feared. He's still trying to compile a list of the items that are missing. <br><br>While we're waiting, we should follow up on those keys you found. If I pull a few strings, I may be able to have them traced."
// RandomFameString :
"P436463089" "Did you hear about Captain Harlan's new charges, {TaskForceName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - WarehouseMeeting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P641365172" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Well, it wasn't easy, but I had those keys you found traced. They belong to an office building over in Founders' Falls. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you'll investigate, we may be able to find out what the Freaks are up to.</A> Kidnapping and theft are their bread and butter, but I really have the feeling there's something bigger going on here."
// AcceptString :
"P4117729202" "Investigate the Freaks' office"
// SendOffString :
"P685405586" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Dr. Minton's still working on the list of items that was stolen from his lab. He may yet be able to provide us a clue to the Freaks' motives."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2280041807" "Defeat Big Marcus & his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P351484351" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Get yourselves to that office and check it out. We need to find out what the Freaks are up to."

