"P315328928" "One of the Freaks yelled, 'You're too late to stop the boss! Soon, we'll have all the nuclear power we want!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2515516294" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>So, the Freaks plan to steal the nuclear material that makes up the Terra Volta reactor core, then use that material to power their implants.  <br><br>Hoo, boy!  It's hard to believe even the Freaks could be that dumb. If they want to blow themselves up, that's fine by me, but we can't let them turn out the lights for the whole city. Looks like you've got a big job ahead of you. I just hope you're up to it."
// RandomFameString :
"P894803120" "{TaskForceName} is going to save us all from the Freaks!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - ReactorCore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P592031449" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Listen up, {TaskForceName}, and don't forget this. Protecting the Terra Volta reactor may be the most important thing you'll ever do for this city. Without that reactor, Paragon City will have to crawl its way up from the Stone Age again. <color orange>You've got to get to Terra Volta and stop the Freakshow's assault.</color> I'm counting on you to make this happen. Don't let me down."
// AcceptString :
"P3405373490" "Save the Terra Volta reactor"
// SendOffString :
"P326292498" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>There's a lot riding on this, heroes. Do me proud."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P138991264" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Get over to the Reactor in Terra Volta!  Protect it all costs!"

