// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4175019744" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>The good news is that the Freedom Corps was able to save the Terra Volta reactor and get it stabilized. The bad news is that most of the Freaks got away. If they try something like this again, I hope I can call on {taskForceName} to take another stand. Please check back with me at your earliest convenience."
// RandomFameString :
"P2418229682" "The Freedom Core saved the Terra Volta reactor!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4189838724" "<color deepskyblue>JAMES HARLAN TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>{taskForceName}, I don't think I've ever been this proud. You saved the Terra Volta reactor, and with it, life as Paragon City knows it. Nothing can diminish that achievement, but we must bear in mind that the Freakshow may try another stunt like this.  Check back with me if you'd like to continue to protect the reactor. <br><br>I don't want to alarm you, but you're looking, well, strange. You should drop by City Hall in Atlas Park and speak to a fellow there named James Wolfe. He's an expert on the effects of radiation; maybe he can tell you if something happened to you during your mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
